{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act32side_level_act32side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act32side",
  "stageId": "act32side_02",
  "title": "Asymmetrical Garden",
  "storyCode": "CR-2",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2e086ac4c0069649890424188a2db6e8709af09d489e2ab9e109c8061738b0b5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_offce"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I believe I found a lead on that thing you asked me to look into."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Word around the casino is that a shipment of Oripathy suppressants is being delivered to that artist community. There are a lot of Infected in there. If we can stop the shipment, maybe..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who's delivering it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A pharmaceutical company by the name of Rhodes Island. It has a bit of a reputation in Dossoles and is linked to Lady Candela... is it dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dangerous...? Let me think..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "By the way, did you get anything on the men who showed up at Reynell's office the other day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry, sir, we tried, but we couldn't find anything..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about our old rivals? The people behind them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nothing there either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you telling me they just dropped from the sky?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe someone doesn't want us digging up their background?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then who is that someone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah... I see... why didn't I think of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What if it's in the Coalition government itself? Plenty of people would love to have my job."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Perhaps even someone who's spent a lot of time under me... what do you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A-Absolutely not! I've always been loyal to you, and to you alone! I swear!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now that I think of it, you wouldn't have the guts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Y-You're absolutely right!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, I have my hands full with what's in front of me, anyway... is there a way to kill two fowlbeasts with one stone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Teach those gangs in the community a lesson, while taking those people down a peg..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mateo",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1210_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What do you remember about their tactics that day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G02"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I thought you had to wait in the customs line for a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It helps that I know the customs officer. I actually borrowed this car from him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I didn't know you had so many friends here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's get the meds delivered, then we can find a beach to lie down and relax."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's no rush. It's a very interesting neighborhood that we're headed to. I think you'll like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A lot of them are engaged in very special creative, spiritual activities, expressing their sentiments about life and everything around them through unique language and media."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm feeling a little confused... could you put it in a simpler way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There are a lot of artists there."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everything is in place, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry, sir, we're properly dressed, and we've memorized the phrases that they used."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Reenacting their accents and tactics won't be easy, but we've got a former Blacksteel guy here who'll take point."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We've handed out the guns, as well as Originium explosives and launchers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, the medicine first, and the fewer people around the better. I know, leave witnesses alive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've got this, sir, no worries."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gun-Wielding Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1272_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're one block away, sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Commanding Officer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1271_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Move, move!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G02"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ernesto, what's that in the middle of the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe someone dropped it. We'll just go around."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait—it's an Originium explosive!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A what?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No time to brake. Jump!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The medicine!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's in a special container. It should survive the explosion... hopefully..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can you stand?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just a little scratch."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're running towards the car!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Guys! There's no one inside! We're here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No response."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is it just me, or do they look more like mercenaries than tourists?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They could have something to do with that explosion. Let's go—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The men find what they need in the car and run away before Tequila can finish.\nThe remaining men point their guns at Catapult and Tequila."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Guns?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who are they, Ernesto?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's what I want to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why are you after the meds?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Squad Leader",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1272_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Open fire!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Damn—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ernesto, get down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Squad Leader",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1272_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Engaging! Six o'clock!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Squad Leader",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1272_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fire! Fire! Keep them pinned down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you okay, Arleta?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm fine. Only one of them is actually shooting properly. The others are just popping launchers—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gun-Wielding Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1272_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Reloading! Cover me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gun-Wielding Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1272_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Twelve o'clock... our man down..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Too many of them. We can't reach the meds."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's get to the alley over there. There's a way out that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Catapult",
      "speakerId": "avg_282_catap_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whisper) Gotcha. I'll cover you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tequila",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whisper) Ten meters, five meters, three meters... Arleta!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G02"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cautious Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The street art community? Why do you ask?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm interested in the arts festival on this flyer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cautious Passerby",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I wouldn't go there if I were you. They aren't people you want to mess with."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Taxi Driver",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I agree. There are a lot of Infected there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Infected? Are they sick?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Taxi Driver",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you kidding me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No one will show us the way. It sounds like a dangerous place. Are we still going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Taxis won't even take us there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe we should report back to Ela and go together with the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Photographer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look what we've got here. The perfect angle, subject and expression. A true work of art."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you just take our photo without permission, sir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Give me the camera, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Photographer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come now, handsome, don't get angry, take a look. I guarantee you'll love it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Photographer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The screen shows the duo frowning at the taxi driving away, as though bothered by its wake, one putting her hands on her hips in frustration, the other covering his nose.\nA snapshot of everyday life at its most amusing, condensed into a single picture."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Pff... that's not bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You do have a good eye."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Photographer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm glad you like it. Fifteen gold certificates, or equivalent in soles or dukats. I'm not picky."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm afraid we have no intention of buying it. And you'll have to delete it as well. We don't want our image to end up somewhere we wouldn't expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Photographer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, if you want it deleted... twenty gold certificates, not a penny less."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're not paying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Photographer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, we're not deleting anything unless you pay up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bastard."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Photographer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, I'm a rascal alright. Problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's getting away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Photographer",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Keep your eyes open for your photos out there! Adios, amigos!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*French swearing*, he's too fast!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not to worry, Kateb. He left a long trail of tire marks behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've been looking for you. Is your photo portfolio ready?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Photographer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just making a couple of quick bucks. Don't worry, I'll have it ready tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You always leave it to the last minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Photographer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll buy you fruit soda to make up for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Forget that, just get your photos ready by tonight, or I'll break your nose."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Street Photographer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ha. See ya!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're going to lose him... that girl is in the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We have to think of something."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They peek out from behind cover to see the girl pick up a spray can and begin spraying graffiti on the alley walls."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whisper) Don't tell me... has she noticed us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whisper) What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whisper) Look at the way she's turning to the left and wincing... is she communicating with someone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whisper) It's possible... their ears work differently. Maybe they can hear us, even when we try to be quiet."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Damn... why now...? Argh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did she just collapse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's ill!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Meijer, keep watch!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Be careful—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's going on, Kateb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're really frowning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't move."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Doc crouches down and examines the girl.\nA strange expression comes over his face, and his brows furrow even deeper."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Doc picks up the fallen spray can while covering his mouth and nose."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm guessing this can hasn't passed inspection."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not sure you can get knocked out by spraypaint, even if it's poorly made."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know... I can only do what I can."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you feeling better, girl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Injector... in my pocket..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's see... this one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Nods slowly)..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good thing you have your own medication, otherwise there wouldn't be much I could do to help you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I thought maybe the spraypaint fumes knocked you out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ha... I smell it every day... it's nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You already look much better."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's my last one..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here, have some water."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where do you live, girl? We'll take you home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't call me 'girl'..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're not afraid of me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm from Paris. I've seen my share of street gangs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gangs? That's not what I'm talking about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doc",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then what is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? You're kind of a weirdo..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The girl lifts the gauze from her right leg, revealing the Originium crystals on her knee."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tecno",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aren't you scared of this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
